Based on the findings of the TPM validation report, the achieved target has been revised. Activities conducted include:
• Developed a technical guideline in 2023; 
• Prepared KMC Plus training manual, provided training for pediatricians and NICU nurses; 
• Provided master level training on KMC for pediatricians and NICU nurses and conducted experience sharing with relevant stakeholders;  
• Developed a face-to-face and blended training guide for KMC Plus and CKMC;
• Developed CKMC training guide and translated into three local languages (Amharic, Afan Oromo and Tigrigna) to ensure accessibility for health extension workers;
• Conducted a consultative meeting with stakeholders to discuss the implementation of KMC plus 
• Conducted SBC and advocacy initiatives to promote the implementation of KMC plus 
• A dedicated KMC room has been set up in selected hospitals as per the standard. 
• Immediate KMC was initiated in selected hospitals as part of the KMC plus strategy

